&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;This exam is an INDIVIDUAL ASSIGNMENT !!!    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;The goal is for your code to behave the same as the provided sample solution (while conforming to specified constraints).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:6pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;==&amp;gt; You may use hand-written &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt4-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt5-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; connect statements on any exam problem &amp;lt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:6pt; font-weight:400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Each problem has its own independent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsScene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; object &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
