           <property name="html">
            <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;2D-Animatation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;           (8 points)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;NOTE:  The goal is for your code to behave the same as the provided sample solution (while conforming to the specified constraints). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Preparation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;(1)  Create a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;resource file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;myimages.qrc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; for all ten PNG image files named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;pm0.png, pm1.png, ... etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; contained within the subdirectory named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;images&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(2)  In the &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Dialog&lt;/span&gt; constructor, use the RESOURCE FILE &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;myimages.qrc&lt;/span&gt; to initialize the provided &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;sprites&lt;/span&gt; one-dimensional array of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPixmap&lt;/span&gt; objects with the ten pixmaps in order from the &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;images&lt;/span&gt; subdirectory&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Upon left-click of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;spawnButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;(3)  Create a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object and load the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPixmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; element from the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;sprites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; array with index &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; into the object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;(4)  Add the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object from the previous step to the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;(5)  Be sure that the &lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;CENTERED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; about the origin of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object (see the hint in the provided code)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(6)  Start the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QTimer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;object named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;timer   [Already configured in the provided code -- you must start the timer !!!]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Advance to next pixmap with each timeout of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;timer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(7)  The custom slot &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;nextPacmanPixmap( )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; will automatically execute on each &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;timer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; timeout.   Add the code to advance to the next pixmap in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;sprites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;.  Be sure to wrap back to the beginning after display of the tenth sprite image.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Modify the provided&lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt; keyPressEvent( )&lt;/span&gt; handler to &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;rotate&lt;/span&gt; the &lt;span style=&quot; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt; left and right about the &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;ORIGIN&lt;/span&gt; of &lt;span style=&quot; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt; as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(8)  Use &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;rotation( )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; method to determine the current orientation of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(9)  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Increment the current rotation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;45 degrees with each press&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; of the PERIOD key (  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Qt::Key_Period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(10)  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Decrement the current rotation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsPixmapItem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;45 degrees with each press&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; of the COMMA key (  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Qt::Key_Comma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(11)  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;Do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;NOT break or alter handling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; of any other key presses    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;HINT:   The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsScene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; object name is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;             The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPushbutton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; objects are named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;spawnButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;             The one-dimensional array of ten &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPixmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; objects is named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;sprites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;NOTE:   The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;QPushButton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; object named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;clearButton3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;already fully operational &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;in the provided code to clear &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:11pt; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;scene3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
